{"sectionId":"immune/adaptive","items":[{"id":"immune--adaptive-k001","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"MHC I은 대부분의 유핵세포에서 세포질 유래 펩타이드를 제시하며 proteasome, TAP, ER 적재 과정이 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k002","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"CD8 T세포가 MHC I-펩타이드를 인식한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k003","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"MHC II는 전문 항원제시세포에서 주로 내재화된 항원을 제시하며 invariant chain과 CLIP, HLA-DM이 적재에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k004","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"CD4 T세포가 인식한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k005","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"수지상세포는 외부 항원을 MHC I로 교차제시할 수도 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k006","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"미경험 T세포 활성화에는 TCR 신호, CD28-B7 공동자극, 분화 방향을 결정하는 사이토카인 신호가 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k007","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"Th1은 IFN-γ와 대식세포 활성, Th2는 IL-4/5/13과 기생충·알레르기, Th17은 IL-17과 점막 방어·염증, Tfh는 B세포 도움, Treg는 FoxP3와 면역 억제에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k008","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"CD8 세포독성 T세포는 perforin/granzyme과 FasL 경로를 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k009","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"흉선에서 양성 선택은 자기 MHC 인식, 음성 선택은 강한 자기반응성 제거에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k010","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"MHC I–CD8, MHC II–CD4.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k011","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"CD28-B7은 공동자극, CTLA-4와 PD-1은 억제 조절에 관여한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k012","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"Th17 분화와 RORγt, Treg와 FoxP3를 연결한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k013","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"IFN-γ는 대식세포 활성 및 항원 제시 증가에 관여한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"immune--adaptive-k014","sectionId":"immune/adaptive","unitId":"immune","subject":"biology","text":"NK세포이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}